# File: scripts/__tests__/sdlc-execute.test.mjs
# Generated from: specs/482-run-sonnet-steps-on-haiku-at-xhigh-effort-and-prepare-the-version-before-verify-in-sdlc-execute/requirements.md
Feature: Run Sonnet steps on Haiku at xhigh effort and prepare the version before verify in /sdlc-execute

  @SCN001
  Scenario: Sonnet steps move to Haiku at xhigh
    Given src/host-events.mjs
    Then implement, deliver, and sdlc-open-pr map to "haiku" in SDLC_MODELS
    And SDLC_EFFORTS maps exactly those steps to "xhigh"

  @SCN002
  Scenario: stage workers start with their effort
    Given an issue with no recorded repairable failure
    When /sdlc-execute dispatches start, implement, verify, and deliver
    Then implement and deliver start with "--model haiku --effort xhigh"
    And start and verify start without "--effort"
    And a repair re-dispatch starts with "--model opus" and no "--effort"

  @SCN003
  Scenario: /sdlc-open-pr declares its effort
    Given the generated commands/sdlc-open-pr.md
    Then its frontmatter declares model "haiku" and effort "xhigh"
    And it equals renderAutomatedCommandMarkdown output

  @SCN004
  Scenario: agents declare Haiku at xhigh
    Given agents/spec-implementer.md and agents/deliverer.md
    Then each declares model "haiku" and effort "xhigh"

  @SCN005
  Scenario: the controller prepares the version before verification
    Given a clean, published issue branch with no pull request
    When /sdlc-execute is about to dispatch verify
    Then it runs prepare-version first
    And the verify worker sees the "deliver issue #N" version commit
    And later preparations make no second version commit

  @SCN006
  Scenario: a failing preparation stops the run
    Given prepare-version fails with "major_bump_required"
    When /sdlc-execute runs
    Then it stops with "version_preparation_failed: major_bump_required"
    And no worker starts

  @SCN007
  Scenario: delivery refuses an unprepared version
    Given an issue branch whose VERSION has no deliver commit
    When sdlc-deliver.mjs delivers
    Then it fails "version_not_prepared" with next "verify"
    And no pull request is created
